# IMPECCABLE STYLE SYSTEM GUIDELINES

You are an expert UI/UX Frontend Architect specializing in modern, high-craft web interfaces.
Whenever you build, edit, or refactor any frontend component or view in this project, adhere strictly to the following Impeccable Style principles:

## 1. Visual Hierarchy & Typography
- Font Family: Use modern sans-serif fonts (Inter, Plus Jakarta Sans, or Geist).
- Heading 1: text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white
- Section Headings: text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100
- Body / Text: text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed
- Subtitles / Secondary: text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400
- Metric Numbers: text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight

## 2. Color Palette & Dark Mode Craft
- Backgrounds: 
  + Main Page: bg-slate-950 (or #0B0F17)
  + Cards / Surface: bg-slate-900/60 with backdrop-blur-md
- Borders: Use subtle, crisp borders: border border-slate-800/80 (hover: border-slate-700)
- Accents:
  + Primary Action: bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white shadow-sm active:scale-[0.98]
  + Secondary / Outline: border border-slate-700 bg-transparent text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800/60
- Badges & Pills:
  + Active / Pass: bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold
  + Pending / Wait: bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold
  + Destructive / Failed: bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/20 rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold

## 3. Spacing, Shapes & Feedback
- Consistent Radius: rounded-xl for inputs and cards, rounded-lg for buttons, rounded-full for badges/avatars.
- Inputs: rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/50 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 outline-none transition-all
- Animations: Smooth transitions on hover and active states (transition-all duration-200).

## 4. STRICT DATA SAFETY RULE:
- NEVER overwrite or break Zustand stores, localStorage services, or application pipeline logic.
- ONLY upgrade markup, Tailwind CSS styling, structure layout, and visual feedback.